WEBVTT

00:04:28.341 --> 00:04:30.559
I'm going to start in Kenya.

00:04:31.027 --> 00:04:33.955
You see here there's
an elephant named Eleanor

00:04:33.979 --> 00:04:36.957
who came one day with bruised legs,

00:04:36.981 --> 00:04:38.862
and she collapsed.

00:04:38.886 --> 00:04:40.083
You see on the left

00:04:40.107 --> 00:04:43.844
that another female named Grace
came to her right away

00:04:43.868 --> 00:04:46.371
and, using her own trunk, propped her up,

00:04:46.395 --> 00:04:48.183
tried to get her up on her feet.

00:04:48.207 --> 00:04:49.402
And she did succeed,

00:04:49.426 --> 00:04:51.684
but then Eleanor collapsed again.

00:04:52.236 --> 00:04:55.610
At this point, Grace became
visibly distressed,

00:04:55.634 --> 00:04:58.893
and she prodded the body,
and she vocalized.

00:04:59.906 --> 00:05:01.297
Eleanor collapsed again,